flowchart TB
  U[User] --> UI[React + TypeScript UI]
  U --> EXT[Optional Browser Companion<br/>outbound-only]
  EXT -->|copy packet / open URL| UI
  UI --> API[Local FastAPI API]

  subgraph Core[Modular Monolith]
    API --> JOBS[Durable Job Queue]
    JOBS --> IMP[Import Adapters]
    IMP --> CAN[Canonical Conversation Model]
    CAN --> SEM[Semantic Interpretation Pipeline]
    SEM --> DET[Deterministic Parsers & Validators]
    SEM --> LOCAL[Optional Local LLM Adapter]
    SEM --> ASSIST[User-Mediated External Analysis Packet]
    ASSIST -->|user pastes response| API

    CAN --> KNOW[Knowledge & Evidence Manager]
    SEM --> KNOW
    KNOW --> RET[FTS5 Retrieval & Context Builder]
    RET --> COO[Objective & Coordination Manager]
    COO --> PACK[Versioned Context Packets]
    PACK --> UI
    API --> RESP[Manual Response Intake]
    RESP --> KNOW

    KNOW --> LEARN[Learning Controller]
    LEARN --> EXP[Bounded Experiment Engine]
    EXP --> EVAL[Evaluation & Regression Gates]
    EVAL --> LEARN
    LEARN --> KNOW
    POL[Policy, Redaction & Audit Layer] --- IMP
    POL --- SEM
    POL --- COO
    POL --- LEARN
  end

  subgraph Persistence[Local Persistence]
    DB[(SQLite<br/>metadata, messages, knowledge,<br/>jobs, experiments)]
    FTS[(SQLite FTS5<br/>full-text indexes)]
    FS[(Local File Store<br/>original archives / exports)]
  end
  IMP --> FS
  IMP --> DB
  CAN --> DB
  KNOW --> DB
  RET --> FTS
  DB <--> FTS
  EXP --> DB
  API --> DB

  PROVIDERS[Consumer AI Websites<br/>ChatGPT / Claude / Gemini / others]
  UI -->|user copies packet| PROVIDERS
  PROVIDERS -->|user manually returns response| UI

  classDef core fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#5279ad,color:#13243a;
  classDef persist fill:#e9f7ef,stroke:#4e9568,color:#153522;
  classDef policy fill:#fff4db,stroke:#bf8a27,color:#4c3711;
  class UI,API,IMP,CAN,SEM,KNOW,RET,COO,PACK,RESP,LEARN,EXP,EVAL,JOBS core;
  class DB,FTS,FS persist;
  class POL policy;